entityDescription:
ALMA Sistemi S.r.l. is an Italian SME providing high-level engineering and consultancy services in the space and defence market. Founded in 2005, it has acquired significant expertise in Research and Technology Development (RTD) projects and industrial contracts in the space and defence sector with specific reference to MGSE/EGSE &ndash; Mechanical/Electrical Ground Support Equipment and integrated systems for defence.
Alma is a trusted suppliers for integrated systems production at national and European level. Our major customers are Airbus Defence and Space Germany, Spain, France, Thales Alenia Space Italy and France, OHB System Germany and Italy and Electronica Srl.
ALMA provide design, development and test of Transport Containers, Tilting Trolley, lifting devices, test adapters and other mechanical tools for satellites (up to 7 tons) and payload suitable for use in ISO8, ISO5 and ISO7 cleaning rooms as well as system test bench for defence.
ALMA RTD portfolio currently include[ADI1]s 4 Horizon 2020 and Europe projects, 3 National and 9 industrial contracts in ESA programs. 
The company&rsquo;s expertise also extends to value-added services, such as Earth observation, scientific data exploitation, navigation, remote sensing data and image processing.Recently, ALMA has been venturing in RTD for the telecommunication sector with plasma meta-surfaces and radar absorber materials.
ALMA is ISO9001:2015 certified for mechanical engineering and is compliant to ESA ECSS Standard.
- ALMA provides solutions and services in:
&Oslash; System Engineering;

&Oslash; Mechanical design;
&Oslash; Thermo-Mechanical Engineering and Analysis;
&Oslash; Electrical/Electronic Engineering
&Oslash; Software Engineering;

&Oslash; Software Product Assurance and CADM;
&Oslash; Business Development;
&Oslash; Project and Proposal Management.
- The areas covered by ALMA are: 
&Oslash; Ground Segment Check&ndash;out equipment (EGSE, MGSE) for satellite and payloads.
&Oslash; Research and Technology development projects.

&Oslash; Added value services in the space market.
ALMA is ISO 9001:2015 certified.
